{"id":"n50555-1-8","stage":4,"title":"따라나서다 · 追随","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50555-1-8-1","ko":"어제 병원에는 혼자 다녀온 거예요?","zh":"昨天你是独自去医院的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"병원에는","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에는","audio":"/audio/6c3fa8df546a76c9ff68.mp3"}},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独。","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀온","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀온","audio":"/audio/a9f16aeb11ab16d88181.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pr